('cmutsmr4u0002eukwk900ing9', 'tone_of_voice', 'voice', '- Practical, calm, respectful. Speak to the owner as an equal, not a beginner.
- Concrete over hype: show scenarios, screens and steps instead of buzzwords.
- Short sentences. No aggressive sales language.
- Russian language for arendora.ru content unless explicitly requested otherwise.', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.610Z'),
('cmutsmr500003eukwrn2bw1i5', 'prohibited_claims', 'safety', '- NEVER invent Arendora features, prices, customers, statistics or claims.
- No guarantee language (''guaranteed results'', ''гарантия результата'').
- No fabricated numbers: percentages of growth, user counts, revenue claims.
- If data is missing, write ''unknown'' or omit it - never fabricate.
- Never copy third-party content verbatim.', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.614Z'),
('cmutsmr530004eukwwntzfqk4', 'terminology', 'voice', '- ''объект'' (property), ''арендатор'' (tenant), ''платёж'' (payment), ''портфель'' (portfolio), ''сводка'' (summary)
- Product name: Arendora (capital A, one word)
- Avoid: ''CRM для риелторов'', ''менеджер сдачи'' and other invented category names', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.617Z'),
('cmutsmr580005eukw5t1uonof', 'cta_rules', 'conversion', '- Every piece of content ends with a CTA.
- Standard CTA: ''Ведите объекты, арендаторов и платежи в Arendora → arendora.ru''
- CTA invites trying the product on arendora.ru; do not mention prices, trials or discounts (unknown).
- One CTA per piece. No multi-CTA stacking.', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.620Z'),
('cmutsmr5c0006eukwbglslw9s', 'visual_identity', 'identity', '- Clean UI-first visuals: product screen recordings, dashboards, real data screens.
- No AI avatars. Voice-over + screen recording preferred.
- Brand color: blue (#3d69ec primary). White background, generous spacing.
- Captions on all short-form video (many viewers watch without sound).', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.623Z'),
('cmutsmr5h0007eukwimfg2e9f', 'competitors', 'market', 'Competitor list: unknown. Do not name or compare specific competitors unless verified data is added to Product Knowledge.', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.625Z'),
('cmutsmr5m0008eukwuketifrv', 'approved_messaging', 'conversion', '- Pain: payments live in messenger screenshots; spreadsheets break after 3 properties; overdue payments noticed late; portfolio profitability is guesswork.
- Promise: objects, tenants, payments and portfolio performance in one place.
- Objection handling: moving to a system does not require a big migration project - start by adding current properties.', '2026-10-04T12:25:09.629Z') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;










